# N1.4: save states from the pause menu (offline). The data folder's nbajam_recomp.ini has
# save_states=1. The first game in the list, the pause menu, Save in slot 1, play on, the
# pause menu again, Load slot 1. The log says "save state: slot 1 loaded, game state ...,
# as saved" when the game state after the load is the one that was saved.
wait 6000
expect menu
tap a
wait 9000
expect game
wait 3000
tap guide
wait 500
expect pause
tap right
tap down 6
shot
tap a
wait 800
shot
tap b
wait 500
expect game
wait 4000
tap guide
wait 500
expect pause
tap right
tap down 7
shot
tap a
wait 1000
expect game
shot
wait 2000
tap guide
wait 500
expect pause
tap down 7
tap a
wait 1500
expect menu
quit
